    "background_story": "Reuben was a man known for his unwavering seriousness. As a renowned journalist, he had a reputation for tackling the toughest stories with unflinching dedication. His sharp mind and keen instincts made him a master of investigative reporting, always getting to the bottom of even the most complex cases. Reuben's seriousness was not just about his work, but also about his personal life. He was a devoted husband and father, always putting the needs of his family first. His no-nonsense approach to life earned him the respect of his peers and the admiration of his loved ones. Despite his tough exterior, Reuben had a soft spot for social justice causes and spent countless hours volunteering for organizations that aligned with his values. His seriousness was a testament to his commitment to making a difference in the world.",
